2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Diego Gutierrez de Cevallos y Caviedes and Juana García Carrillo y Alvarez Osorio, Señora de Villabáñez 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20LATER%20MEDIEVAL%202.htm#_Toc277571926 Project MedLands, SPANISH NOBILITY]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''PEDRO López de Ayala'''  His ancestry is set out by Argote Molina [4] . Lord of Unza, Mena and Albudeite. Adelantado mayor of the kingdom of Murcia.  '''Mistress (1) :  INÉS de Azagra,''' daughter of ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Pedro had two illegitimate children by Mistress (1): INÉS de Azagra'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * a)          '''PEDRO López de Ayala''' Señor de Campos, Albudeite and Yeast. Alférez mayor del P endón de la Banda 1367, as such present at the battle of Nájera. 
2 CONT * b)          '''[5] FERNANDO Pérez''' (-after 2 Dec 1378 [6] , bur Quijana, Torre de Ayala). Lord of the Ayala Valley.  [7] . Ayala´s Crónica de Pedro I records that King Pedro I granted " a land ... Las Encartaciones ... near Vi
2 CONC zcaya " to " Don Ferrand Perez de Ayala " in 1351 [8] .  He was the author of a genealogical treatise on his family ' Ayala Lords Lineage Book ' [9] , completed by his son.  '''married ELVIRA Álvarez de Ceballos,''' daughter of DI
2 CONC EGO Gutiérrez de Ceballos & his wife Juana García Carrillo [10] (-before 1372, bur Quijana, Torre de Ayala).  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fernando & his wife had ELVIRA five children:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>* i) '''PEDRO López de Ayala "the Chronicler"''' (Vitoria 1332-Calahorra 1407, bur Quijana, Torre de Ayala). Lord of Ayala and Salvatierra de Álava. Chancellor of Castile 1406-1407.  M ost of King Juan I of Castile. Greater Mer
2 CONC ino from Guipúzcoa.  Ensign Major of the Banda Bande 5 Sep 1371 to 21 Jul 1385.  '''married LEONOR de Guzmán,''' daughter of PEDRO Suárez de Toledo Señor de Bolaños & his wife María Ramírez de Guzmán. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Pedro & his wife LEONOR had two children:'''           
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>>* (a) '''FERNÁN Pérez de Ayala''' (-17 Sep 1436). Lord of Ayala and Salvatierra de Álava. Ensign Major of the Banda 1402.  '''married  MARÍA Sarmiento Señora de Salinillas,''' daughter of DIEGO Gómez Sarmiento Señor de Salina
2 CONC s & his wife Leonor de Castilla (-1438).        
2 CONT
2 CONT COUNTS of SALVATIERRA and AYALA . 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>>* (b)        are. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>* ii)          '''INÉS Alfonso de Ayala married DIEGO Gómez de Ayala,'''  are of ---.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Two children:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>>>* (a)        '''SANCHA de Ayala  married WALTER Blount,''' are of ---. 
2 CONT >>>>>>* (b)        '''TERESA de Ayala''' (-31 Aug 1424). Florez records a donation made to Santo Domingo el Real by " Doña Ines de Ayala " which names " Maria my fixed granddaughter of King D. Pedro ... of my fixed Doña Teresa, Pr
2 CONC ioress ... of the Sorores of Santo Domingo el Real ”, Dated 15 Jun 1395 [11] . Prioress of Santo Domingo el Real. An epitaph in Santo Domingo el Real records the death 31 Aug 1424 of " Doña Teresa de Ayala, Prioress of this Monast
2 CONC ery, daughter of D. Diego Gomez de Ayala, Mayor of Toledo, and Doña Ines de Ayala " [12] .  '''Mistress of: PEDRO I "el Cruel" King of Castile and León,''' are of ALFONSO XI "el Justo" King of Castile and Leon & his second wife In
2 CONC fanta dona Maria de Portugal (Burgos 30 Aug 1334-murdered Montiel 22 Mar 1369). 
2 CONT >>>* iii) '''ELVIRA from Ayala, married PEDRO Suárez de Guzmán,''' son of PEDRO Suárez de Toledo & his wife María Ramírez de Guzmán. 
2 CONT >>>* iv) '''LEONOR de Ayala,'''  Lady of Torrejón de Velasco. Her marriage is confirmed by the charter dated 11 Sep 1441 which her daughter " Doña Maria de Ayala daughter of Fernán Álvarez de Toledo, lord of Hijares and of Mrs. Te
2 CONC resa de Ayala Mrs. de Pinto " issued relating to " her inheritance of Dosbarruelos, municipality of Toledo " [13] .  '''married  (1366) FERNANDO Álvarez de Toledo Lord of Valdecorneja,''' they are of --- GARCÍA Álvarez de Toledo &
2 CONC  his wife Mencia de Meneses (-near Lisbon 1384). 
2 CONT >>>* v) '''ALDONZA de Ayala'''   " Pedro González de Mendoza lord of Hita y Buitrago, major butler of King Juan I and his wife Aldonza de Ayala " donated property to " his eldest son Diego Hurtado de Mendoza major admiral of Casti
2 CONC lla " by charter dated 14 Nov 1376 [14] .  '''married ([1360]) as his third wife, PEDRO González de Mendoza Señor de Hita,''' son of GONZALO Ibáñez de Mendoza & his wife Juana de Orozco (Guadalajara [1340] -killed in battle Aljuba
2 CONC rrota 9 Sep 1385, bur San Francisco de Guadalajara ).
2 CONT
