2 CONT Constance of Castile Memorial
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1354, Spain Death: 	Mar. 24, 1394 Leicester Leicester Unitary Authority Leicestershire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT English Royalty. The Queen of Castile and Duchess of Lancaster, when her father Pedro the Cruel was killed she became Queen of Castille. John the Duke of Lancaster married her and tried to regain her throne. The couple did not suc
2 CONC ced but Catherine their daughter married the King of Castille. (bio by: girlofcelje) 
2 CONT
