2 CONT      Juana Garcia de Leyva married Diego Lopez de Zuniga, 1st Count of Plasencia, 1st Senor de Bejar, 12th Senor de Zuniga, son of Inigo Ortiz de Zuniga, 11th Senor de Zuniga, Lord of Alesanco & Las Cuevas, Mayor of Seville and Ju
2 CONC ana Lopez de Orozco.1,2 Juana Garcia de Leyva Her mother is purported to be Elizabeth, daughter of King Edward III of England. This is very doubtful.1
2 CONT Family
