1 NOTE 3rd senor de villa de Alcaudete,
2 CONT "Juan Ponce de Leon hace cesion del Mayorazgo a su hijo, mayor, (iligimo) Pedro Ponce, Sevilla 22 March 1450.
2 CONT Archiv. Seccion Noblez del Archivo Historico Nacional
2 CONT Sig: Ocuna,C.117,D.13
2 CONT In a document dated 1460-1461 there seems to be a family shakeup because everyone has been forced to renounce their heretical rights. "Renuncia de los hereditos a favor de Juan Ponce de Leon II," there seems to have been another o
2 CONC ne before him. ""Conde de los Arcos de todo derecho que pudieron tener a la casa y mayorazgo de Arcos. Escritura de renuncia de: Alavar Perez de Guzman, hijo de Alfonso de Guzman y Sancha Ponce de Leon, hija de Pedro Ponce de Leon
2 CONC  y Maria de Ayala. (Alcala de Guadaira 12 Agosto 1461."
2 CONT The document above continues on listing the whole family. You will find the continuation of the source and its statement on other scrolls, herein varifying the extensive work and research I have done on this family tree. As always
2 CONC , if you use any information from this tree you must site me, the author, John J. Browne Ayes using my full name.
2 CONT Continuation of Renunciamiento de hereditos:From above:
2 CONT "Juan Ponce de Leon hace cesion del Mayorazgo a su hijo, mayor, (iligimo) Pedro Ponce, Sevilla 22 March 1450.
