2 CONT 3. 2ND COUNT OF HARO PEDRO6 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO (PEDRO5, JUAN4, PEDRO3, FERNAN2 SANCHEZ-DE-VELASCO, SANCHO1) was born Abt. 1415, and died 01 Jun 1492. He married MARQUESES MENCIA DE MENDOZA-Y-FIGUEROA, daughter of INIGO LOPEZ-DE-
2 CONC MENDOZA and CATALINA SUAREZ-DE-FIGUEROA. She was born 1430.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for 2ND COUNT OF HARO PEDRO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO:
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the 2nd Count of Haro, Constable of Castile,
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARQUESES MENCIA DE MENDOZA-Y-FIGUEROA:
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1st Marqueses de Santillana, and the sister of the Duke of Infantado. 
2 CONT
2 CONT From her marriage, she held the title of the Countess of Haro.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of PEDRO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO and MENCIA DE MENDOZA-Y-FIGUEROA are:
2 CONT * 6. i. 1ST DUKE OF FRIAS BERNARDINO7 DE VELASCO, d. 1512.
2 CONT * 7. ii. 2ND DUKE OF FRIAS INIGO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, b. Abt. 1460; d. 17 Oct 1528.
2 CONT * 8. iii. LEONOR DE-LA-VEGA-Y-VELASCO, b. 1450.
2 CONT * 9. iv. MARIA DE VELASCO.
2 CONT * 10. v. ISABEL FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, b. 1465.
2 CONT * 11. vi. CATARINA DE VELASCO.
2 CONT
