2 CONT Son of Thomas le Despenser and Constance Langley. '''Husband of Lady Eleanor de Neville, married after 23 May 1412. He died without issue. He succeeded to the title of 4th Lord Burghersh in August 1409, and was invested as a Knigh
2 CONC t, Order of the Bath on 08 April 1413.'''
