1 NOTE !HISTORICAL NOTES:
2 CONT     Richard Plantagenet and his wife, Cecily Neville, lived during the 15th Century. They have been chosen to begin the Royal Ancestors pedigree because of their common descent from a host of kings and royal families, including Ki
2 CONC ng EdwardIII of England. They were also the parents of two English kings--Edward IV and Richard III--who ruled England from 1461 to 1485. The name Plantagenet comes froma long line of Plantagenet kings who ruled England for about 
2 CONC 300 years. The Neville family was one of England's most influential families during the 14th and 15th centuries.
1 NOTE !HISTORICAL NOTES:
2 CONT     Richard Plantagenet and his wife, Cecily Neville, lived during the 15th Century. They have been chosen to begin the Royal Ancestors pedigree because of their common descent from a host of kings and royal families, including Ki
2 CONC ng Edward III of England. They were also the parents of two English kings--Edward IV and Richard III--who ruled England from 1461 to 1485. The name Plantagenet comes from a long line of Plantagenet kings who ruled England for abou
2 CONC t 300 years. The Neville family was one of England's most influential families during the 14th and 15th centuries.
