1 NAME Isabel /Plantagenet/ Countess of Essex
2 GIVN Isabel
2 SURN Plantagenet
2 NSFX Countess of Essex
2 _MARNM Plantagenet
2 NICK Isabella
2 NICK Isabel of Cambridge
2 NICK Isabel of York
1 NAME Isabel of Cambridge
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC St Mary the Virgin Churchyard, Little Easton, Essex, England
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 SEP 1411
2 PLAC Conisbrough Castle
2 ADDR
3 CITY Conisbrough
3 CTRY England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 OCT 1484
2 ADDR
3 CITY Little Easton
3 CTRY England
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Isabel of Cambridge, Countess of Essex (1409 – 2 October 1484) was the only daughter of Richard, 3rd Earl of Cambridge and Anne Mortimer. She was the sister of Richard Plantagenet, 3rd Duke of York, and like him a great-grandchil
2 CONC d of Edward III of England."
2 CONT
