1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 7. 2ND DUKE OF FRIAS INIGO7 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO (PEDRO6, PEDRO5, JUAN4, PEDRO3, FERNAN2 SANCHEZ-DE-VELASCO, SANCHO1) was born Abt. 1460, and died 17 Oct 1528. He married MARQUESES MARIA DE TOVAR-Y-VIVERO 1480, dau
2 CONC ghter of LUIS DE TOVAR and MARIA DE VIVERO-Y-SOTOMAYOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for 2ND DUKE OF FRIAS INIGO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO: 2nd Duke of Frias, 4th Count of Haro
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARQUESES MARIA DE TOVAR-Y-VIVERO: 1st Marqueses de Berlanga.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of INIGO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO and MARIA DE TOVAR-Y-VIVERO are:
2 CONT * i. 3RD DUKE OF FRIAS PEDRO8 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, d. 10 Nov 1559; m. JULIANA-ANGELA DE VELASCO-Y-ARAGON.
2 CONT * 15. ii. 1ST MARQUEZ OF BERLANGA JUAN DE VELASCO-Y-TOVAR.
2 CONT * 16. iii. ISABEL DE VELASCO.
2 CONT * iv. INIGO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO-Y-TOVAR.Notes for INIGO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO-Y-TOVAR:On November 15, 1647, he served as Governor of Milan.
2 CONT * v. BERNARDINO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO-Y-TOVAR.Notes for BERNARDINO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO-Y-TOVAR:On Febuary 24, 1646, he served as Governor of Milan.
