2 CONC (of Kent).She married, secondly, Christopher Worsley before 8 November 1464.2 ' Her married name became Brooke.1 Her married name became Worsley. 'Child of Elizabeth Tuchet and Edward Brooke, 6th Lord Cobham (of Kent)
