2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 163.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 301.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 391.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 125.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. I, p. 146-147.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 297-298.
2 CONT *[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. XII/2, p. 383.
2 CONT *[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. XII/2, p. 384.
2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 200.
2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 510-511.
