2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p10199.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Countess of Warwick in 1459.
2 CONT
2 CONT In DEC 1487, Henry VII restored to her the BEAUCHAMP estates so she could then legally turn them over to him. He allowed her to retain the manor of Erdington where she lived until her death in 1492, at age sixty-six.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1426.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: The Sunne in Splendour by Sharon K. PENMAN issued by Macmillan, London.
2 CONT
