1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ='''Be very careful: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth de Beauchamp 1417-1480, daughter of Richard de Beauchamp, Earl of Warwick, 1382-1439 and Elizabeth Berkely m1. George Neville, son of Ralph Neville and Joan Beaufort; m2. Thomas Wake 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth de Beauchamp 1415-1448, daughter of Richard de Beauchamp, Earl of Worcester, 1397 – 1422 and  Isabel de Spencer m. Edward Neville, son of Ralph Neville and Joan Beaufort 
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabel de Spencer, mother of Elizabeth de Beauchamp of Worcester m2. Richard de Beauchamp of Warwick 1382-1439.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT (Janet Palo-Jackson 4 Jan 2010)
2 CONT
2 CONT =============================================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT "Elizabeth de Beauchamp (16 September 1415 Hanley Castle, Worcestershire, England – 18 June 1448) was the only child and heiress of Richard de Beauchamp, Baron Abergavenny and 1st Earl of Worcester, by Isabel, daughter of Thomas l
2 CONC e Despencer, Earl of Gloucester by Constance of York, granddaughter of Edward III."
2 CONT
2 CONT ==================================================================================
