2 NOTE “ Lady Elizabeth Beauchamp, Lady of Abergavenny, was born to Richard Beauchamp & Isabel de Despenser. She married Sir Edward Neville before 1424.(His 1st wife). Mother of Richard H. Neville, Sir George Neville, Alice Neville and C
3 CONC atherine Neville. She is buried in The Carmelites, Coventry, Warwickshire, ENG.
3 CONT According to Peerage.com: "He, (Sir Ed) cohabited with 2nd wife Katherine during lifetime of his lst wife (Eliz)." 
3 CONT His wife, the only child of Richard (Beauchamp), Earl of Worcester (d. 1422), brought him the great estates which had come to her line with FitzAlan and Despencer heiresses, and in 1450 he was summoned as Lord Abergavenny, though 
3 CONC not seized of that castle.)” find a grave 
