2 CONT *''''''     Sir Henry Bourchier was born circa 1428 at of Great Totham, Essex, England. He married Elizabeth Scales, daughter of Sir Thomas Scales, 7th Lord Scales, Seneschal of Normandy and Isamina Whalesborough, circa 1445.1 Sir
