2 CONT
2 CONT Cesáreo Fernández Duro pointed out that Juan de Valencia had a daughter out of wedlock, although he does not mention his name, and that he was the mother of the commander Pedro de Ledesma.''[40]'' 
2 CONT
2 CONT And Salazar and Acha added that this daughter was called '''Serafina''' and that she married Gonzalo Rodríguez de Ledesma, lord of Santis and Lasmenal.''[33]''
