1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Doña Maria de Luna, cafó con Don Enrique Enriquez, tio y Mayordomo mayor del Rey Catolico Don Fernando: fue Almirante de Sicilia, Comendador mayor de Leon, Alcayde y Alferez mayor de la ciudad de Baza, Señor de las
2 CONC  villas de orce, Galera, Cortes, Sierra de Filabres, Senefcaftro, Luca y Neva, hermano de padre de Doña Juan Enriquez Reyna de Aragon. Historia de la Muy Ilustre Casa de Sousa Capitulo XVI. El Grande San Francisco de Borja, y fus 
2 CONC defcendientes los Duques de Gandía. Pag 280
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Doña María de Luna married Don Enrique Enríquez—uncle and *Mayordomo Mayor* (High Steward) to the Catholic King Don Fernando. He was Admiral of Sicily, Grand Commander of León, *Alcaide* (Governor) and *Alférez Mayor* (Chief Stand
2 CONC ard-Bearer) of the city of Baza, and Lord of the towns of Orce, Galera, Cortes, Sierra de Filabres, Senés, Castro, Lucainena, and Nerva; he was also the paternal half-brother of Doña Juana Enríquez, Queen of Aragon. *History of th
2 CONC e Illustrious House of Sousa*, Chapter XVI: "The Great Saint Francis Borgia and his descendants, the Dukes of Gandía," p. 280.
