1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Arrived to the New World with Christopher Columbus in the Gallega on his [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyages_of_Christopher_Columbus#Fourth_voyage 4th voyage in 1502] that attempted to circumnavigate the world f
2 CONC or the first time. He submitted his enrollment into the ship's crew in Seville on March 15 of 1502. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Columbus called this voyage his greatest and most challenging one. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?list=PL687D5606DCB2A5D2&v=J7GF2wuFi0o "Columbus:The Lost Voyage"]
2 CONT
2 CONT After surviving the voyage, Garcia de Polanco was one of the 38 men that decided to stay in La Hispaniola instead of returning to Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is uncertain whether he died in the Island of Santo Domingo or if he stayed there continuously without returning to Spain at some point. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Leon Guerrero, Montserrat. [https://dialnet.unirioja.es/descarga/articulo/2756103.pdf "Los Pasajeros del Cuarto Viaje de Colon"]. Page 12
2 CONT
