1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Pedro Fernández de Torquemada was the father of Tomás de Torquemada (1420-1498) who was the Grand Inquisitor of Spain in the period 1483-1498. His birth date has been estimated @ 1390 based on the birth date of his son in 1420 (30
2 CONC  yrs old).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Tree
2 CONT
2 CONT brothers Juan & Pedro --> Alvar Fernández de Torquemada --> Pero Fernández de Torquemada --> Lope Alfonso de Torquemada (Knighted by Alfonso XI) [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * < [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Fernández_de_Torquemada-2 Wikitree] > cites 
2 CONT **1.  Roth, Norman, "Conversos, Inquisition, and the Expulsion of the Jews from Spain", 1995. < [https://books.google.fr/books?id=nzJ5340UZKMC&pg=PA225&lpg=PA225&dq=Álvar+Fernández+de+Torquemada&source=bl&ots=eo-TmCXjwE&sig=gWK2WS
2 CONC SZexnJtE4r2y0NRst7aBg&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwi8xLHfuNvdAhVPyYUKHdpZDeUQ6AEwEXoECAUQAQ#v=onepage&q=Álvar%20Fernández%20de%20Torquemada&f=false GoogleBooks] > 
