1 NOTE Was the heroic figure in the last phase of the Reconquest of the defeat and expulsion of the Moors from Spain. Rodrigo was called the second Cid. Was the first Duke of Cadiz. And he was the father of Francisca Ponce de Leon. Third
2 CONC  Count of Arcos
2 CONT Source: Arch. Gen. de Simancas
2 CONT Sig:RGS,148502,220
