2 CONC tafford, Staffordshire. His Father was John Sutton Vth. John 1st Baron Dudley married Elizabeth de Berkeley of Beverstone, sometime after March 14, 1420. The sons of Dudley by this marriage were: Edmund Sutton, John Sutton Dudley 
