2 CONC rd Dudley was rewarded after the battle for his participation on the side of Edward, Earl of March, son of Richard, Duke of York. On June 28 of that year, Edward IV was proclaimed King in London. Battle of Bosworth Field 1485 Foll
2 CONC owing the battle, Dudley was created Sheriff of Sussex by the new King Henry VII.
