2 CONT 1st Baron Dudley 1460 - Knight of the Garter 1428 - Treasurer of the King's household under Henry VI 1439 - Summoned to Parliament 1422 - Standard Bearer at King Henry V's funeral 1428 - Lord Lieut. of Ireland 1446 - Ambassador to
2 CONC  Duke of Britanny Embassy to Duke of Burgandy 1451 - Imprisoned by Richard, Duke of York at Gloucester 1455 - Fought in Battle of St. Albans, taken prisoner in Tower of London 1459 - wounded in Battle of Bloreheath Pardoned by Edw
