2 CONT ====Citations
2 CONT * 1. Tim Boyle, "re: Boyle Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 16 September 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Boyle Family."
2 CONT * From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p32018.htm#i320177 ____________
