2 CONT *''''''     Jane Whitney was born circa 1450 at of Whitney, Herefordshire, England. She married Sir Roger Vaughan, son of Sir Roger Vaughan and Denise fil Thomas, circa 1469; They had 4 sons (Watkin, Esq., John, Harry, Esq., & Tho
2 CONC mas, Esq.) and 4 daughters (Elinor, wife of Thomas Gwyn, of Hywel ap Gwilym, & of William Dometh); Elizabeth; Margred, wife of John Parker; & a daughter married to Jenkin ap Thomas). By a mistress or mistresses he also had Thomas,
2 CONC  Roger, & Robert.1,2
