2 CONT
2 CONT I have three sources that have Watkin Vaughan as the son of Roger Vaughan and Joan Whitney. The first is the National Library of Wales (Electronic Resouces/Welsh Biography Online) http://www.llgc.org.uk/cronfa/index_s_adel.htm.
2 CONT
2 CONT They cover all branches of the Vaughan family. All of the Vaughan lines are discussed by place of residence. Watkin is found in the Vaughans of Porthaml section. This source does not even mention a marriage to Eleanor of Somerset.
2 CONT
2 CONT The second source is The Bingham Genealogy Project, http://www.telusplanet.net/public/dkbing/genproj.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Douglas Bingham has an extensive list of resources that he used in his research. He has Roger Vaughan marrying Joan Whitney first, Watkin as their oldest child (consistent with the previous source) + 7 others. He has Roger marryin
2 CONC g Eleanor Somerset second, no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT From Welsh Biography Online
2 CONT
2 CONT VAUGHAN family, of Porthaml , parish of Talgarth , Brecknock . This branch of the Vaughan family was founded by ROGER VAUGHAN, second son of Sir Roger Vaughan of Tretower. Roger Vaughan of Talgarth was granted the offices of stewa
2 CONC rd and receiver of the lordship of Dinas, 17 Jan. 1509, and was dead before 25 Sept. 1514, when those offices were granted to Sir Griffith ap Rice. His wife was Joan, daughter of Robert Whitney by Constance, daughter of James, lor
2 CONC d Audley. The Vaughans of Tregunter descended from his second son, Thomas Vaughan. The heir, WATKIN VAUGHAN, m. Joan, daughter of Ieuan Gwilym Vaughan of White Peyton. The family became prominent with his heir, WILLIAM VAUGHAN, wh
2 CONC o obtained a lease of the demesne lands of Dinas, 14 Feb. 1529.
2 CONT
2 CONT The third source is a family history, "Kin of Mellcene Thurman Smith". I don't know the source of the info contained in this book. This author has Roger first married to Eleanor of Somerset, no children, and married second to Joan
2 CONC  Whitney with Watkin as their oldest child.
2 CONT
2 CONT (THIS THIRD SOURCE WOULD NOT BE CORRECT AS THE ROGER THAT MARRIED ELEANOR SOMERSET HAS A DIFFERENT DEATH DATE THEN ROGER THAT MARRIED JOAN WHITNEY)
2 CONT *<nowiki>--------------------</nowiki>
2 CONT
