2 CONT *Pg. 24
2 CONT **VAUGHAN family, Of Porthaml, parish of Talgarth, Brecknock. X ref Tretower 
2 CONT *''''''This branch of the Vaughan family was founded by Roger Vaughan, second son Of Sir Roger Vaughan of Tretower-see Vaughan family of Tretower. He was possibly the Roger Vaughan Of Tyle-glas who was pardoned on 9 July 1491, and
2 CONC  figures again in Henry VIII's pardon roll (1509) as Roger ap Roger of Tyle-glas, or Roger Vaughan Of Talgarth. He was granted the offces of steward and receiver of the lordship of Dinas, 17 Jan. 1509, and was dead before 25 Sept.
2 CONC  1514, when those offices were granted to Sir Griffith ap Rice. His wife was Joan, daughter of Robert Whitney by Constance, daughter of James, lord Audley. The Vaughans of Tregunter descended from his second son, Thomas Vaughan. T
2 CONC he heir, Watkin Vaughan married. Joan, daughter of leuan Gwilym Vaughan Of White Peyton. ....
2 CONT *http://archive.org/stream/VaughanFamilyOfWales/VaughanFamily#page/n24/mode/1up
2 CONT *Pg. 25
2 CONT *Sir Roger Vaughan third son of Roger Vaughan of Bredwardine-see Vaughan family of Bredwardine-by Gwladys, daughter of Dafydd Gam, was the first of the Vaughans to reside at Tretower. It is said that the residence ....
2 CONT *.... He was twice married. The first wife was Denise, daughter of Thomas ap Philip Vaughan of Talgarth, and she was the mother of the heir (Sir) Thomas Vaughan, ''''''Roger Vaughan-see Vaughan family of Porthaml''''''-and four da
2 CONC ughters who married into prominent families, the wives of Robert Raglan, Henry Donne, Morgan Gamage, and Morgan ap Thomas ap GrufFudd ap Nicolas. His second wife was Margaret, lady Powis, daughter of James, lord Audley, by his sec
2 CONC ond wife, Eleanor, illegitimate daughter of Edmund, earl of Kent. (Her first husband, Sir Richard Grey, lord Powis, d. 17 Dec. 1466. She was dead before 2 Feb. 1480/1.) She had one daughter by Sir Roger, the wife of Humphrey Kynas
2 CONC ton. A large number of illegitimate children are ascribed to Sir Roger Vaughan.  •_________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT *''''''(The body of text for Sir Robert Whitney's page does not list a dau. Joanne who married a Thomas Rogers, but she could of been overlooked. Plantagent Ancestry & Magna Carta Ancestry do not list her.) 
