2 CONT *https://books.google.com/books?id=t99PVFm380UC&pg=PR25&lpg=PR25&dq=Jacqueline+Neville+1517&source=bl&ots=wrr09PcISv&sig=atZiT2eJBsp2N4qSb51NocoFmnU&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0CE8Q6AEwCDgUahUKEwjixqPtgr7HAhVELYgKHZfSAJo#v=onepage&q=Jacquelin
