2 CONC rquess of Dorset"[981].  She married secondly (Manor of Grafton Regis, Northamptonshire 1 May 1464) Edward IV King of England. She was crowned Queen of England 26 May 1465 at Westminster Abbey.  Her second marriage was declared nu
