1 NOTE {geni:about_me} new unsourced single direct climbing USER line connection to medieval tree of https://www.geni.com/people/Juan-Fernandez-de-Hijar-conde-de-Belchite/6000000012569948393 (...-1509)
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://www.geni.com/list/descendants/6000000057638402042#9
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://www.geni.com/path/Torbio-Hernandez-de-Hijar-y-Arellano-Ramirez+is+related+to+Ed-Trujillo?from=6000000057638402042&path_type=blood&to=6000000007679473265
2 CONT
