1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Maria of Castile Queen consort of Aragon, Majorca, Valencia and Sicily
1 CONT Countess consort of Barcelona
1 CONT 1458–1468 Succeeded by
1 CONT Isabella I of Castille
