1 CONT [edit] Children
1 CONT
1 CONT His children with Cecily Neville include:
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Joan of York (1438-1438).
1 CONT    2. Anne of York (August 10, 1439 – January 14, 1476), consort to Henry Holland, 3rd Duke of Exeter.
1 CONT    3. Henry of York (b. February 10, 1441, died young).
1 CONT    4. Edward IV of England (April 28, 1442 – April 9, 1483).
1 CONT    5. Edmund, Earl of Rutland (May 17, 1443 – December 31, 1460).
1 CONT    6. Elizabeth of York (April 22, 1444 – after January, 1503), consort to John de la Pole, 2nd Duke of Suffolk.(His first wife was Margaret Beaufort).
1 CONT    7. Margaret of York (May 3, 1446 – November 23, 1503). Married to Charles the Bold, Duke of Burgundy.
1 CONT    8. William of York (b. July 7, 1447, died young).
1 CONT    9. John of York (b. November 7, 1448, died young).
1 CONT   10. George, Duke of Clarence (October 21, 1449 – February 18, 1478). Married to Isabel Neville. Parents of Margaret Pole whose husband's mother was the half-sister of Margaret Beaufort.
1 CONT   11. Thomas of York (born c. 1451, died young).
1 CONT   12. Richard III of England (October 2, 1452 – August 22, 1485). Married to Anne Neville, the sister of Isabel Neville.
1 CONT   13. Ursula of York (born 22 July 1455, died young).
1 CONT
